{
  "id": "1CH.28",
  "number": "28",
  "bookId": "1CH",
  "reference": "1 Damanyoojiga 28",
  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "28",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 28"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "28",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'asheega rukuta Dawdi aba badayda gheeda sibata ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu ghabwada geat Dawdi fuga hees aba Yerusalemu, fuga hees bea eemoojiga, ea fuga hees ambal lugweega sin gadiyeeda sugoocheanda nea gwalageanyi, was fuga hees ambal sagalamnyoojiga, ea fuga hees ambal bughalajeega, ea gea ahaaghwa haleanjeeda ea ng'eanyoojiga sugoocheanda, ea gea diibigaaschi, sea gulanga, ea fuga meanyi, was headiga meanyi sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghang'eat sugoocheanda was Dawdi ak ghamiinaada aba geeshangaaschi, ak gwayeesha, “Oolleeysean iit, buweadeegeasu, ea buuneedeanyu; aniini ghayi geagasayi aba gurooroodeanyu deesta gheeda miy jea goobiida sandakwajeanda neajeeda bea NG'UTAMIIDA, ea hoorgeeda jea gwayiina geeshangaaschi ASEETEANYA; ak geadiing'diing'di nea gaydadeas; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amadu gwayeeshiinean ASEETA, ‘Ang'iing'i maydeasa gheeda aba gheawungeasu, aba gideaba ang'iing'i guwoosi siida ng'ucheeda, ak ea niihiidi foojeanda.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwaloadan NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA Israeli, aba gheesean was gheeda ghaheanya doaw sugoocheanda Israeli damanda manda muudeanooda; aba gideaba niloat Yuda gwaheedu; nea aba gheeh Yuda, ghwaloat gheeda ghweanda jiilnean, ea aba jeeda orjooga bwaabwa, amadu ghwaloadan aniini ak goombiidan doaw sugoocheanda deambal Israeleesean; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea aba jeeda orjoogeasu sean (aba gideaba nigoonan NG'UTAMIIDA orjooga saang'a), niloat Sulemani was orjeedeanyu goopteada aba uhuuda hoorgeeda ghaambiidaat bea sugoocheanduumeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, aba badayda Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeeshiinean, ‘Sulemani, orjeedeanyu siida jea ghwadeas gheenyu ea giibindeanyu; aba gideaba naaloachi ghoah orjeedeanyu, ak gaydoaw ghwaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea sugoocheanduumeadaanyi gaydeamajeek damanda manda muudeanooda, iyang'waay muuchi diigheanyeekeasu ea girgweaguutkeasu, gawuurji gideaba ghamneawa.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa, aba madeeda gheanyanga Israeleesean, fiisu bwat geat bea NG'UTAMIIDEAN, nea ghwayiiy iita ASEETEANYA, asikteawana gideaba ghoang'waanyi diigheanyeeka sean bea NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETEANG'WA, ak abeeda goombali ng'eanyiini miyiin, nea ghoanung' gwahearan orjoogeagwa jea gamaseawneegwa damanda manda muudeanooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea ang'iing'i, Sulemani, orjeedeanyu, nala ASEETA gweanu, ak gigadiyeesi aba guroorooda miy, nea ghaamwanyi jeadaang'u; aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA gagaseadayi gurooruunatka sean, nea ghwanal ng'asheega sean ea fugheerga; nea gigasayi niny, ak gaydaaha; nea iinung'usi heeda gaygwajaktaneey damanda manda muudeanooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi shageada; aba gideaba ang'iing'i niloanyi NG'UTAMIIDA deasa gheeda jea ghoah heeda ghaydit; asi daruusiida ak gisini ng'asheanji.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoadaw Dawdi orjeedaanyi was Sulemani badiida sean bea gichea eadeasta gheeda sibata ASEETA, ea ghoorajeagaaschi, ea heechea eetiiwsa haleanjeeda sean, ea ghoorajeega diyeada, ea ghoorajeagaaschi bea jih, ea heeda hoorgeeda baydeayda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea badiida ng'asheega sean mida jeadaanyi, ea muhealuutka gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ea gea ghoorajeega sean neaweesa, ea heeda siitiiwshacheewa bea gheeda ASEETA, ea heeda siitiiwa haleanjeeda siikghaydiit; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea iita galanyoojiga ashoohoodiga ea fuga Lawi, ea dea gadiyoojiga sea bea gadiyeesiinda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ea dea dabita sean bea gadiyeeda NG'UTAMIIDA; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gea dahaabu siiteen aba dabita dahaabu, ea dabita sean sigadiyeata aba giliwas gadiya; gea lapiya siiteen aba dabita sean bea lapiya, ea dabita sean sigadiyeata aba giliwas gadiya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba durumanata hoorgeeda gheaboong'nyeanda sisna dahaabu ea gheaboonyanga nyaawa, ea durumanata dahaabu aba giliwas hoorgeeda gheaboong'nyeanda ea gheaboonyanga nyaawa, ea durumanata lapiya aba giliwas hoorgeeda gheaboong'nyeanda ea gheaboonyanga nyaawa, aba giduurji gadiyeeda giliwas hoorgeeda gheaboong'nyeanda sigadiyeata, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea durumanata dahaabu aba giliwas measa bea mukaateeyda giihiimnooda, dea lapiya bea measeeda lapiya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gwarukuta gichea gwadeena dahaabooda miyaasiin jea eesina ganakwajeega mideawa geeshatka, ea giihearmajeega, ea gikoombajeega; ea gea gweerajeega dahaabu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea gichea gwadeena dahaabooda miyaasiin jea eesina heeda wagiida jea eeghwardeaysa geediga ng'andidi ea gea jea eesina mutukwajeega was geeruubajeega jea ghoadaarda gea munyas, nea gookwa sandakwajeanda neajeeda bea NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'asheesu sean rugu Dawdiin, naanali aba ng'ooruutka aba geatinda NG'UTAMIIDA, huumwa, gadiyoojiga sean rukunean gideaba sina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwalamda Dawdi ak gwayeesha orjeedaanyi was Sulemani, “Majeegiida nea gimwaanyiidi, ak gisini. Adibeali, ak ea adipri; aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, was ASEETEANYU, giideayi sea niny. Maygwanung'useey heeda ghana gwajaktaneey, ea ghwahit gadiyoojiga sean bea deesta gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ging'ulayi, lageanyeeni bea ashoohoodigean ea fuga Lawi aba gadiyoojiga sean bea gheeda ASEETA; buuneesean geariirji aba haleanjeeda sean nea gagasa weataang'u, nea buuneesean ea fuga nyaawa hees gayghoang'waay huumeandaang'u.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
